# thor-qwen4-qsa-fp6 -- the QSA fp6 (e2m3) main cache, QFN (2026-11-21)
#
# The dense path's packed-fp6 scheme (mjolnir.kvfp6) on qwen4_exp QSA pools,
# as a first-class kv-cache-dtype: fp6_e2m3 (the pluggable-dtype API
# registers the name via mjolnir.kvdtype). The pool rides the NOT-fused
# path (MJOLNIR_QSA_NOFUSED is forced by the fp6 configs): its
# impl.do_kv_cache_update is the mjolnir writer and the calibration
# observer; the stock fallbacks expand touched pages to e4m3. The fp6
# arms also carry block-size 1152 (the E8 ring fix).
diff --git a/vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/qsa.py b/vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/qsa.py
